OL,3,GNEWSAPC sacked for speeding 75 times in
OL,4,Atwo months
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn Essex Police officer has been sacked
OL,7,Fafter he was caught speeding 75 times
OL,8,Fin two months while on duty.
OL,10,FPC Jake Lay-Flurrie, who was posted in
OL,11,FBraintree, drove at more than double
OL,12,Fthe speed limit on five occasions
OL,13,Fbetween August and October 2025.
OL,15,FHe was described as a "passionate and
OL,16,Fwell-regarded officer" acting "with
OL,17,Fgood intent" during a misconduct
OL,18,Fhearing in Chelmsford.
OL,20,FHowever, Chief Constable Rachel Nolan
OL,21,Fsaid Lay-Flurrie demonstrated "a
OL,22,Frepeated failure to follow the rules".
